    {
      "title_cn": "三星电子公布2026年第三季度业绩",
      "title_en": "Samsung Electronics Announces Third Quarter 2026 Results",
      "title_original": "Samsung Electronics Announces Third Quarter 2026 Results - Samsung Global Newsroom",
      "source": "Samsung Global Newsroom",
      "published_at": "2026-10-29T01:10:00+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://news.samsung.com/global/samsung-electronics-announces-third-quarter-2026-results",
      "category": "consumer_tech",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "三星电子公布截至2026年9月30日的2026年第三季度业绩：合并营收195.3万亿韩元，环比增长14%；营业利润107.4万亿韩元。其设备解决方案（DS）部门销售额环比增长15%，存储业务季度营收和营业利润均创历史新高。",
      "what_happened_en": "Samsung Electronics reported third-quarter 2026 results for the quarter ended Sept. 30, 2026: consolidated revenue of KRW 195.3 trillion, up 14% quarter-on-quarter, and operating profit of KRW 107.4 trillion. Its Device Solutions Division posted a 15% QoQ sales increase, and the Memory Business set all-time quarterly highs for revenue and operating profit.",
      "why_it_matters": "三星称其成为全球首家季度营业利润突破100万亿韩元的科技公司，显示半导体需求对行业盈利的强大拉动。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "Samsung says it is the world's first tech company to exceed KRW 100 trillion in quarterly operating profit, a signal of how strongly semiconductor demand is shaping industry earnings.",
