    {
      "title_cn": "Cloudflare 2026年第三季度DDoS威胁报告：小规模攻击增多，超大攻击减少",
      "title_en": "Cloudflare DDoS Threat Report 2026 Q3: More Swarms, Fewer Giants",
      "title_original": "Cloudflare DDoS Threat Report 2026 Q3: More swarms, fewer giants",
      "source": "Cloudflare Blog",
      "published_at": "2026-10-29T12:55:00+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://blog.cloudflare.com/ddos-threat-report-2026-q3/",
      "category": "internet",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "Cloudflare第26期DDoS威胁报告覆盖2026年第三季度，发现持续不足10分钟、带宽低于1 Gbps的短时攻击激增208%，超过1 Tbps的攻击较第二季度下降近69%，CLDAP洪水攻击环比骤降99.5%。",
      "what_happened_en": "Cloudflare's 26th DDoS Threat Report, covering Q3 2026, found short-burst attacks under 10 minutes and 1 Gbps surged 208%, while attacks above 1 Tbps fell nearly 69% from Q2 and CLDAP floods collapsed 99.5% quarter-over-quarter.",
      "why_it_matters": "攻击转向更小规模、更高频次，显示网络防御者面临的威胁模式正在变化。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "The shift toward smaller, more numerous attacks signals changing threat patterns for network defenders.",
